1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This video will explain to you how to make a rolled scarf in the hollow.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
First, create a new fabric in the object window.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Then use the lifting plate tool to create a lifting plate of 2500x5mm.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Thickness of the lifting plate is 25mm.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Thickness of the lifting plate is 25mm.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Use the positioning tool in the 3D window.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Place the lifting plate in front of the scarf.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Then add a row of fixed needles to the top of the scarf.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Hold the lifting plate.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Then select the scarf plate.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Set the thickness of the lift plate to 3.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Pressure to 10.

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Use the lift plate.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Simulation.

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
You can see that the scarf is automatically rolled up due to the pressure.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,000
You can hold the lift plate.

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Press the lift plate.

18
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Hold the lift plate.

19
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Pull the scarf.

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
The scarf will automatically roll up.

21
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:45,000
When the scarf is over, you need to pull it.

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,000
If it is a shorter version, you do not need to pull it manually.

23
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:54,000
You can add fixed needles to help adjust the flow.

24
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,000
You can add fixed needles to help adjust the flow.

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Choose all the plates

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Use the positioning tool to rotate it 90 degrees

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Then move to the ground center

28
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Choose the scarf plate and move to the ground center

29
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,000
simulation

30
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:23,000
The scarf plate will be neat under the weight

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Next, improve the quality of the scarf

32
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Click to confirm

33
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Open the simulation

34
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Adjust the shape of the scarf

35
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Choose the shape plate

36
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Adjust its conflict thickness to 25 mm

37
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Organize the package shape of the scarf plate

38
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Click to confirm

39
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Next, choose the scarf plate

40
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Increase the thickness of the scarf

41
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:19,000
To 3 mm

42
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Open the simulation

43
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Then adjust the conflict thickness to 3 mm

44
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:33,000
After the simulation is even

45
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:41,000
We again increase the conflict thickness to 3.5 mm

46
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
Open the simulation

47
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:54,000
After the simulation is even, you can delete the shape plate

48
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Choose the scarf plate

49
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,000
Use the positioning tool to rotate it 90 degrees

50
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Use the positioning tool to rotate it 90 degrees

51
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Right click and place it in the ground center

52
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,000
simulation

53
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Then delete the fixed needle in the middle

54
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,000
After the simulation

55
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Right click to remove hardening

56
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,000
And the same process

57
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Repeat the simulation

58
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Then let's make the stack effect of three scarfs

59
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Copy a scarf

60
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Move the copied scarf to the ground center

61
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Then drag it out with the positioning tool

62
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Place it in the right place

63
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Then copy a scarf plate again

64
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:14,720
In the same way, put it on top of the two scarfs.

65
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:23,920
Adjust its position.

66
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:26,240
Put two scarfs on top of the two scarfs before freezing.

67
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:29,040
Then turn on the simulation.

68
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:38,480
Make the upper scarf naturally fall on top of the two scarfs.

69
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:41,360
Freeze.

70
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:47,480
Next, enter the enamel window.

71
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:53,480
Enamel at the same time, check the effect of enamel.

72
00:05:53,920 --> 00:06:00,080
The effect of the enamel is the same as the effect of the enamel at the same time.

73
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:09,520
The above is how we make a scarf in the kiln.

74
